  "title": "Q082 퀴즈 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 082</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>82 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"82번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:76%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q082\" data-question=\"Q082\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q082</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 provides DNS, CloudFront delivers content, and S3 stores objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 performs HTTP path-based load balancing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 caches S3 objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront grants IAM roles</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 응답과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a> 캐싱, 객체 저장은 각 서비스의 다른 역할이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q081/\">이전 문제 <b>Q081</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">다음 문제 <b>Q083</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
